<p>Engulfs your hands (and weapons) in a sheath of lightning, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11, 14, 17, 20, 22</acronym> lightning damage with a chance to daze (25%) per melee attack and increasing all lightning damage dealt by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">7%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15%.</acronym></p><p>Each hit will also regenerate <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.33, 0.67, 1.00, 1.33, 1.67</acronym> mana.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Spellpower.</p>